# Omnichannel (shared core)

This is one Modular Monolith. Do not add a second API, database, inventory source, or bot backend.

## Stock and price

- Retail projection uses only `retailStock` / `retailPrice` / `retailSalePrice` and `showOnRetail`.
- Wholesale projection uses only `wholesaleStock` / `wholesalePrice` / `wholesaleSalePrice` and `showOnWholesale`.
- Never read legacy `stock` in Feed, Basalam, storefront availability, or omnichannel projection.
- Only Inventory/Order services may change stock. Connectors never decrement or overwrite stock.

## Transactions

- Variant reload and `syncProductStockFromVariants` must use the same `EntityManager` as the stock UPDATE.
- Stock change and `inventory_movements` insert are one transaction. Checkout SALE must write a movement.
- Movements are immutable; reverse with a `REVERSAL` row, never hard-delete.

## Side effects

- External delivery (SMS, affiliate, search, Telegram/Bale/Rubika) goes through transactional outbox + worker after Phase 2/3.
- Secrets stay as `secretRef` only. Never persist or return provider tokens.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — Feed availability from legacy/wholesale stock
const stock = Number(variant.stock) || Number(product.stock) || 0;

// ✅ GOOD
import { channelAvailability } from './channel-product-projection';
const { stock } = channelAvailability(product, 'RETAIL');
```
